B.GF=s(["Bu s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n alt\u0131ndaki kararlar kesindir; istinafa g\xf6t\xfcr\xfclemez.","Bu s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n alt\u0131ndaki kararlar do\u011frudan Yarg\u0131tay\u2019da temyiz edilir.","S\u0131n\u0131r yaln\u0131zca ceza davalar\u0131nda uygulan\u0131r.","S\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n \xfczerindeki kararlar kesindir."],t.s)
B.N9=new A.aE("kanun_04",B.c0,'Malvarl\u0131\u011f\u0131na ili\u015fkin davalarda istinaf "kesinlik s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131" ne anlama gelir?',B.GF,0,"HMK m. 341: Miktar veya de\u011feri belirli bir tutar\u0131 ge\xe7meyen malvarl\u0131\u011f\u0131 davalar\u0131na ili\u015fkin kararlar kesindir (istinaf edilemez). Bu s\u0131n\u0131r her y\u0131l yeniden de\u011ferleme oran\u0131nda artar; g\xfcncel tutar\u0131 teyit et.")
